WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
As I stand in the wind on a hill by a port town,

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
minatomachi oka no ue kaze wo uke

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
mezurashii kurai atama wa karappo

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
my head feels unusually empty.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
I was watching the town from the south side of the shore.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
haruka minami mukougishi de kono machi wo miteita

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
And so I sunk my unsteady passion into the depths of the sea.

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
guratsuita jounetsu wo umi ni shizumeta

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
This surging power...

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
tome donaku afureru chikara

00:29.073 --> 00:31.160
Black Jack

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
It's something hidden in everyone, everywhere.

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
sonnamono wa darenimo dokonimo hisonde iru mono

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
Day after day, everyone tries their best.

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
mainichi mainichi minna ganbaru

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
But people get annoyed when I mention it.

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
sore wo ieba hito wa mina kemutagaru

00:57.685 --> 00:59.376
Oh FREEDOM

00:59.376 --> 01:01.369
will be there

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
It makes me glad...

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
yokatta

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
That I found my place here.

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
ibasho ga koko ni attakara

01:12.127 --> 01:13.645
Oh WISDOM

01:13.645 --> 01:15.494
will be there

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
I searched for the reason

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
sagashita

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
why we can believe in the same air

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
onaji kuuki shinjirarerukoto

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
as long as we're alive.

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
ínochi aru kagiri

01:32.678 --> 01:34.763
He weaves the thread of life with his miraculous control of a scalpel.

01:34.847 --> 01:37.031
The genius surgeon who lives on a cape.

01:37.183 --> 01:39.794
His name is Black Jack.

02:47.937 --> 02:51.066
Originally "Unfinished House" by Tezuka Osamu

02:47.937 --> 02:51.066
The House on the Cape is Incomplete

03:10.790 --> 03:11.790
I'm back.

03:18.094 --> 03:18.924
What's this?

03:30.607 --> 03:32.900
Doc! Welcome home!

03:32.901 --> 03:34.568
Dinner's ready.

03:46.414 --> 03:47.002
Here you go.

03:49.376 --> 03:50.542
Thank you for the dinner.

03:50.543 --> 03:51.710
Go.ahead.

04:09.187 --> 04:13.607
Don't just eat without saying anything! Look around!

04:16.089 --> 04:16.689
No.

04:17.195 --> 04:18.311
Why?

04:18.947 --> 04:22.408
I've decided that I won't move, rebuild, or remodel.

04:22.409 --> 04:23.534
Why?!

04:23.535 --> 04:24.952
I'm tired of it!

04:24.953 --> 04:28.497
This house doesn't get clean no matter how hard I scrub!

04:28.498 --> 04:32.448
I want to live in a new house!

04:42.762 --> 04:44.985
We can still live in it, even if it's not clean.

04:45.473 --> 04:46.657
Stop complaining.

04:47.183 --> 04:49.727
It's not like some princess is going to come visit.

04:49.728 --> 04:51.750
Ohmigewdness!

04:51.863 --> 04:55.478
I'm ashamed of this place!

04:55.574 --> 04:59.429
I want a better-looking clinic!

04:59.988 --> 05:00.738
Here!

05:01.323 --> 05:02.781
No means no!

05:04.367 --> 05:05.451
Come with me!

05:06.536 --> 05:08.829
Come and see this!

05:08.830 --> 05:11.874
Whose handprint is that?!

05:12.375 --> 05:13.834
It's creepy!

05:13.835 --> 05:16.509
Why is it there?

05:16.796 --> 05:18.105
Oh, that?

05:18.506 --> 05:19.840
You finally noticed?

05:23.303 --> 05:25.345
And what's this?

05:25.465 --> 05:26.830
It was left unfinished.

05:28.231 --> 05:29.622
Jeez, Doc!

05:30.011 --> 05:31.313
What's wrong with you?

05:31.561 --> 05:34.730
You have enough money to rebuild it!

05:34.731 --> 05:35.856
You're stingy!

05:37.025 --> 05:38.589
Sure I do.

05:39.361 --> 05:43.364
But I don't want to rebuild it.

05:44.199 --> 05:45.407
Why?

05:46.951 --> 05:51.341
It was ten years ago that I found this
place and started living here.

06:03.218 --> 06:07.044
It was a vacant house, standing
all alone on a slanted cape.

06:07.191 --> 06:08.751
For Sale

06:07.191 --> 06:08.751
Hidamari Realtors

06:09.140 --> 06:10.683
It looked old on the outside,

06:10.684 --> 06:13.060
but the foundation was made
of stone and was very sturdy.

06:23.822 --> 06:28.139
It happened right when I was talking with
the realtor about remodeling the house.

06:33.248 --> 06:35.981
Are you the potential buyer of this house?

06:36.418 --> 06:38.460
I am, but who are you?

06:38.461 --> 06:40.671
It's still standing!

06:40.672 --> 06:43.072
No cracks either. Sure is strong.

06:43.550 --> 06:46.853
I'm Ushigoro, a carpenter.

06:47.157 --> 06:49.304
I'm the one who built this house.

06:49.639 --> 06:52.808
You're the carpenter who built it?

06:52.809 --> 06:53.850
Yes.

06:54.102 --> 06:58.125
It was about fifty years ago that I built it.

06:58.606 --> 07:01.554
It's been standing here for fifty years!

07:01.901 --> 07:04.653
And it doesn't budge easily.

07:04.654 --> 07:06.124
Um, hey...

07:06.614 --> 07:08.991
So what does this carpenter want?

07:08.992 --> 07:13.308
I came since I heard it was about to be remodeled.

07:17.250 --> 07:20.210
Please let me do it!

07:20.211 --> 07:23.380
I don't want another carpenter to touch it!

07:24.513 --> 07:26.133
Please!

07:32.807 --> 07:37.811
That Ushigoro guy was so insistent about it.

07:37.812 --> 07:43.454
So I gave in and asked him to start
working on it the next day.

07:51.117 --> 07:52.159
Good morning!

07:53.119 --> 07:54.119
There's just the two of you?!

07:54.704 --> 07:57.317
Yes. This is my entire crew.

07:57.666 --> 08:01.460
Having a bunch of scumbags would do no good anyway.

08:10.804 --> 08:13.347
Ushigoro sure was skilled.

08:14.641 --> 08:18.352
He did everything fast and neatly.

08:19.521 --> 08:22.731
But he was very strict with his young apprentice.

08:25.005 --> 08:26.527
Scum!

08:27.821 --> 08:28.654
Clutz!

08:31.408 --> 08:32.658
Useless!

08:33.118 --> 08:34.493
Wuss!

08:34.494 --> 08:35.119
I'll do it!

08:35.245 --> 08:36.203
Watch how it's done!

08:39.457 --> 08:41.333
That's great.

08:41.334 --> 08:42.876
It's all even and nothing was wasted.

08:42.877 --> 08:46.696
Idiot! This is your job!

08:50.677 --> 08:52.852
I can't watch anymore!

08:53.179 --> 08:55.347
This is how you plane!

08:59.436 --> 09:00.978
You really are awesome.

09:00.979 --> 09:03.018
You're so much better than me.

09:03.481 --> 09:08.822
Young people nowadays are so lazy.

09:09.988 --> 09:12.906
Boss, it's time for lunch.

09:12.907 --> 09:15.367
Shut up and watch how it's done!

09:22.751 --> 09:24.168
It's one o'clock already.

09:24.169 --> 09:25.127
Shut up.

09:32.761 --> 09:34.325
It's two o'clock already.

09:34.637 --> 09:36.263
So what?!

09:38.183 --> 09:41.604
Um, it's three o'clock already.

09:41.853 --> 09:45.814
You want to eat before finishing the
work you're supposed to do?!

09:47.025 --> 09:48.776
I'm so hungry though!

09:48.777 --> 09:50.866
I haven't eaten anything since last night.

09:50.953 --> 09:53.760
Why are all young people like this?

09:54.324 --> 09:58.137
Don't they want to learn how it's done?

10:01.998 --> 10:03.740
You scumbag!

10:05.627 --> 10:09.713
Eating while your master's working?!

10:11.675 --> 10:16.220
I'll lock you up in a barrel and bury...

10:23.814 --> 10:24.814
Boss?

10:27.295 --> 10:28.816
B-Boss?

10:30.151 --> 10:32.695
Sir! He's in trouble!

10:39.953 --> 10:41.412
What's wrong?

10:41.913 --> 10:43.037
It's his usual sickness.

10:43.373 --> 10:44.623
This happens to him from time to time.

10:50.255 --> 10:52.798
Sorry about this, Doctor.

10:53.550 --> 10:54.800
What's your illness?

10:56.344 --> 10:59.209
It's nothing serious.

10:59.472 --> 11:01.061
Must be anemia.

11:01.433 --> 11:03.285
Let me examine your blood.

11:03.852 --> 11:06.153
Are you kidding me?!

11:06.479 --> 11:09.023
Don't make this bigger than it needs to be, Doctor!

11:11.109 --> 11:12.901
I'll see you tomorrow.

11:12.902 --> 11:14.236
Now, excuse me.

11:28.335 --> 11:29.335
This is...

11:30.587 --> 11:32.629
This is terrible. Just terrible!

11:33.673 --> 11:34.965
He has leukemia!

11:36.551 --> 11:38.594
Quite serious too!

11:40.096 --> 11:41.555
Leukemia?

11:42.015 --> 11:43.849
Yes, leukemia.

11:44.726 --> 11:47.707
It was a difficult disease to cure back then.

11:48.730 --> 11:50.898
Hey, morning.

11:51.733 --> 11:53.390
Hey Boss! Where's your truck?

11:53.818 --> 11:54.902
And what happened to your apprentice?

11:54.903 --> 11:57.307
He quit.

11:57.503 --> 11:58.503
He quit?

11:59.491 --> 12:00.824
He had no resolve.

12:01.036 --> 12:03.367
He didn't even last a week.

12:03.828 --> 12:06.330
It's nothing new to me. Don't worry.

12:08.625 --> 12:12.161
I'm different from those other wimpy carpenters.

12:12.837 --> 12:15.255
I'll be working by myself starting today.

12:15.531 --> 12:16.453
That's ridiculous!

12:16.883 --> 12:18.312
I don't need the repairs.

12:18.802 --> 12:20.594
You need to rest!

12:21.137 --> 12:21.970
What?!

12:21.971 --> 12:24.056
You don't like my work?!

12:24.179 --> 12:25.072
That's not why!

12:25.517 --> 12:26.892
You're ill.

12:27.143 --> 12:28.727
You have a serious case of leukemia!

12:30.480 --> 12:32.982
I took your blood sample while you were unconscious.

12:34.192 --> 12:36.089
I can't let a sick person work on the house.

12:36.569 --> 12:39.989
As a doctor, I can't allow you to do such heavy labor.

12:41.324 --> 12:46.619
Then are you going to let some
stranger work on this house?

12:47.080 --> 12:48.752
Please don't!

12:48.994 --> 12:50.708
This house is mine!

12:50.796 --> 12:53.836
Please let me at least keep working on this house!

12:53.837 --> 12:57.913
Don't you realize you may die tomorrow?

13:01.636 --> 13:04.734
Sorry, but your life will be in danger if we
don't get you to a hospital right away.

13:05.432 --> 13:08.246
You need to rest and get better first.

13:10.687 --> 13:11.895
Fine.

13:12.314 --> 13:15.190
I need to get to a hospital and rest, right?

13:16.192 --> 13:19.028
But I'll work on the house at the same time.

13:19.029 --> 13:19.903
What?!

13:20.322 --> 13:22.432
It's simple.

13:23.408 --> 13:28.871
You see, I'll be the first patient to stay at your clinic.

13:29.331 --> 13:30.831
Wh-What are...

13:30.832 --> 13:35.640
Then you can just treat me here, and I won't
have to climb up the hill to get here.

13:35.879 --> 13:37.796
This is what people call killing two birds with one stone.

13:38.214 --> 13:39.284
That's absurd!

13:39.883 --> 13:43.530
This house is still being built, and I
don't have the proper equipment.

13:43.803 --> 13:46.013
I can't possibly keep someone as seriously ill as you...

13:46.169 --> 13:47.890
Quit your yapping!

13:47.891 --> 13:50.070
If you don't have the equipment, buy it!

13:50.393 --> 13:52.978
If you don't have a room for me, I'll build one!

13:53.772 --> 13:55.997
Hey man, aren't you a doctor?

13:56.232 --> 13:59.356
Then do your job!

14:00.070 --> 14:02.476
Why are you so adamant about this house?

14:02.989 --> 14:04.573
Simple.

14:06.326 --> 14:09.403
This is my masterpiece.

14:09.996 --> 14:15.959
And for carpenters, the houses
they build are like their sons.

14:23.426 --> 14:24.363
Fine.

14:24.803 --> 14:28.639
Boss, you'll be the first patient to be hospitalized here.

14:29.432 --> 14:32.163
But I won't allow any heavy labor!

14:32.552 --> 14:33.169
Got that?

14:45.657 --> 14:49.034
All right, Doctor, get the board up here!

14:49.828 --> 14:51.379
Man, what a pain!

14:54.791 --> 14:58.127
Hey, Doctor, do you see that handprint there?

15:00.588 --> 15:01.170
Yeah.

15:02.507 --> 15:05.217
It's the handprint I made to commemorate building it.

15:05.265 --> 15:06.077
Commemorate?

15:06.469 --> 15:14.005
I always leave my handprint on any house I build.
With permission from the owner, of course.

15:15.103 --> 15:19.064
Well, even when I don't get their permission,
I secretly put it in the attic.

15:22.861 --> 15:26.651
This house was built as a vacation home for someone.

15:26.906 --> 15:32.202
They wanted a house that would withstand
the salty air and typhoons, so I used stone.

15:32.471 --> 15:34.288
Just you wait, Doctor.

15:34.289 --> 15:39.376
I'll build you a simple-looking, but
very comfortable exam room.

15:50.805 --> 15:52.431
Here you go, Boss!

15:53.933 --> 15:56.268
Dammit! Not this size!

15:56.269 --> 15:57.644
I told you I wanted the other one!

15:57.645 --> 15:59.826
Be more careful! Are you blind?

16:01.358 --> 16:03.192
Oh, sorry.

16:03.193 --> 16:04.360
Force of habit.

16:28.051 --> 16:32.176
Use that saw and shorten that board
by a shaku and two sun.

16:43.113 --> 16:45.793
That's it. Hey, that's really good.

16:46.069 --> 16:49.405
Want to quit being a doctor and become my apprentice?

16:50.115 --> 16:51.156
Hey, now.

16:55.150 --> 16:55.869
Watch out!

17:06.631 --> 17:07.991
I've really aged.

17:08.550 --> 17:12.421
I used to have much more energy.

17:12.517 --> 17:13.526
You're asking for too much.

17:13.888 --> 17:17.224
Fatigue is one of the symptoms
of leukemia as well as fevers.

17:18.935 --> 17:20.678
You satisfied yet, Boss?

17:21.385 --> 17:22.752
You'll really keel over.

17:24.274 --> 17:26.194
Don't worry, Doctor.

17:26.693 --> 17:28.610
I won't die yet.

17:31.031 --> 17:37.786
I may not have much to live for these days,
but I still have this house to finish.

17:49.758 --> 17:52.157
Can't you at least let someone else do that?

17:53.261 --> 17:56.218
As if any young people could do
the work of a real craftsman!

18:06.733 --> 18:08.075
Dammit!

18:10.892 --> 18:11.547
Boss!

18:11.571 --> 18:13.405
Stop being so stubborn, Boss.

18:16.159 --> 18:19.374
I won't go down so easily.

18:19.621 --> 18:21.948
There are still things I need to do.

18:22.207 --> 18:23.155
Boss...

18:23.917 --> 18:27.336
Doctor, which would you choose?

18:29.714 --> 18:33.499
Choosing to live but not being able
to do what you want to do most...

18:33.927 --> 18:37.763
or finishing your masterpiece even
if it costs you your own life?

18:39.786 --> 18:40.576
I would...

18:40.600 --> 18:42.707
Sorry, but I'd choose neither.

18:45.230 --> 18:48.273
If I were you, I would choose to keep on living
and continue making masterpieces.

18:50.193 --> 18:51.607
True enough.

19:11.006 --> 19:12.267
<i>It's not working.</i>

19:12.841 --> 19:14.455
<i>The symptoms are getting worse.</i>

19:15.093 --> 19:17.223
<i>The medication isn't doing much for him.</i>

19:17.762 --> 19:19.367
<i>He shouldn't even be walking around.</i>

19:19.931 --> 19:21.140
What's the matter?

19:21.141 --> 19:23.225
Hurry up and get me better.

19:23.560 --> 19:24.935
You're asking for the impossible.

19:26.229 --> 19:28.182
How pathetic.

19:28.523 --> 19:30.971
And you still call yourself a doctor?

19:35.280 --> 19:37.611
Don't worry, Doctor.

19:37.949 --> 19:40.107
I'm not going to die yet.

19:40.618 --> 19:46.373
I may not have much to live for these days,
but I still have this house to finish.

19:47.042 --> 19:50.034
<i>He is living by sheer will alone.</i>

19:50.337 --> 19:53.672
<i>No, by his obsession to finish this house.</i>

19:54.883 --> 19:56.986
<i>If this house is completed...</i>

20:03.975 --> 20:05.895
<i>In order to save his life...</i>

20:12.942 --> 20:18.405
Boss, you must be treated at a bigger hospital.

20:22.855 --> 20:23.855
Right.

20:25.246 --> 20:29.442
I want to keep on living and continue
making masterpieces.

20:35.215 --> 20:38.842
Doctor, I promise I'll return...

20:38.843 --> 20:41.693
and finish the spots I left unfinished.

20:42.097 --> 20:45.224
Don't let anyone touch them.

20:46.518 --> 20:48.264
It's a promise, Doctor.

20:48.812 --> 20:49.477
Yes.

21:02.701 --> 21:04.116
And I promise you...

21:04.494 --> 21:09.491
that I'll become such a great doctor that I'll even
have your approval next time we meet.

21:18.008 --> 21:20.342
Make sure you come back, Boss.

21:24.848 --> 21:26.890
The promise has yet to be fulfilled.

21:28.059 --> 21:32.082
I'm waiting for the day I can see him again.

21:34.065 --> 21:37.943
Now do you see why I can't work on this house?

21:38.528 --> 21:41.905
Will he be back after he gets better?

21:42.741 --> 21:45.968
Yes, I'm sure of it.

21:46.745 --> 21:50.116
Knowing him, I'm sure someday...

22:10.537 --> 22:17.543
I want to capture your heart with my silly smile.

22:10.537 --> 22:17.543
itazura no hohemi de muchuu ni sasetaino

22:17.544 --> 22:24.716
Only look straight at me.

22:17.544 --> 22:24.716
massugu na kimi no me ni watashi wo utsushitene

22:24.761 --> 22:32.018
Being kind isn't good enough.

22:24.761 --> 22:32.018
yasashii dake dewa nanika tarinaino

22:32.019 --> 22:42.528
I want to get in touch with your true heart, deep
within the you that nobody else sees.

22:32.019 --> 22:42.528
dare nimo misenai kokoro no oku no sotto furetai

22:42.529 --> 22:47.909
Being in the gentle sunlight,

22:42.529 --> 22:47.909
yawaraka na hizashi abite

22:47.910 --> 22:57.293
I wish on the clover that plays the melody of dreams,

22:47.910 --> 22:53.115
yume wo kanaderu clover

22:53.570 --> 22:57.294
kaze ni negai wo nosete

22:57.294 --> 23:08.054
and I search for a ray of hope beyond the blue skies,

22:57.294 --> 23:08.054
aoi sora no mukou e kibou no hikari sagasuno

23:08.055 --> 23:13.142
because I want to stay by your side forever.

23:08.055 --> 23:13.142
zutto soba ni itakara

23:13.143 --> 23:26.113
The promise we made long ago in a far away place...

23:13.143 --> 23:26.113
haruka kanata de zutto mae kara

23:26.114 --> 23:33.037
is finally coming to a realization, overcoming the incredible distance,

23:26.114 --> 23:33.037
hikari ni terasare michibikareru youni

23:33.038 --> 23:43.923
just as it was lead by the light.

23:33.038 --> 23:36.971
sora no hate tooku

23:37.064 --> 23:43.864
toki wo koete ima tadori tsuku

23:45.070 --> 24:15.086
A Dolphin and some Robbers

23:46.883 --> 23:50.370
Doc's been kidnappped!

23:50.383 --> 23:51.563
We're busy right now!

23:51.643 --> 23:53.323
Are you hanging in there?

23:54.943 --> 23:57.276
We have a man we need you to treat.

23:57.489 --> 24:00.901
I heard you could cure anyone as
if you could perform miracles.

24:01.139 --> 24:03.739
I'll drop you in the sea if you refuse.

24:03.753 --> 24:04.586
Take him to a hospital.

24:04.659 --> 24:06.912
We're going off shore, out
of the country's water.

24:07.019 --> 24:08.819
We don't have to let the dolphin die.

24:08.893 --> 24:10.058
Go to hell.

24:10.206 --> 24:11.581
All of you, jump off the boat!

24:12.126 --> 24:14.553
Next Karte - A Dolphin and some Robbers.

24:16.160 --> 24:17.786
Karte NG...

24:18.613 --> 24:20.820
The BJ shoot
has been moved
to Studio Three.

24:19.866 --> 24:20.866
Again?

24:22.753 --> 24:23.653
Nobody told me.
